      "title": "\u26a1 ApexForge \u2014 RIFE Frame Interpolation",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# \u26a1 ApexForge \u2014 RIFE Frame Interpolation\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udfe3 RIFE VFI (Frame Interpolation)\n**Model:** `rife_v4.26.safetensors`\n\ud83d\udcc1 **Location:** `ComfyUI/models/frame_interpolation/`\n> Doubles video FPS \u2014 24fps \u2192 48fps, 25fps \u2192 50fps\n\n---\n## \ud83e\udde9 Required Custom Nodes\n- ComfyUI-Frame-Interpolation (Fannovel16)\n\n---\n## \ud83d\udca1 Tips\n- multiplier=2 doubles frame count and FPS\n- multiplier=4 quadruples \u2014 use for very slow-motion output\n- Fast mode is slightly lower quality but much faster\n- Best used after InfiniteTalk, Wan2.x, or any video generation\n- Set VHS_VideoCombine frame_rate to match your target FPS\n\n---\n## \ud83d\udcda ApexForge by Alex Harte\n\ud83c\udf10 **Guides & updates:** https://alexanderharte.com\n\ud83d\ude80 **All models are pre-installed on your pod.**\n\ud83c\udfa8 **Just load this workflow and start generating.**"
      ],
      "color": "#231535",
      "bgcolor": "#3f2460"
    },
